@@ -2,6 +2,22 @@
 
 Changes ship continuously from `main`. Every item links to its live preview on [ui.teamofsilicons.com](https://ui.teamofsilicons.com).
 
+## 2026-11-12
+
+### Changed
+
+- **[Dialog](https://ui.teamofsilicons.com/dialog) without a visible header (#31).** `hideHeader` keeps the title and optional description available to assistive technology while removing the header, close button and body padding. `placement="top"` places a dialog near the top of the viewport for command palettes; the default stays centered.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- **[Command palette](https://ui.teamofsilicons.com/command-palette) keyboard access (#30).** The Esc button's accessible name now includes its visible label, result options leave the Tab sequence while arrow keys continue to select them, and quiet text uses the higher contrast secondary token.
+
+## 2026-11-08
+
+### Fixed
+
+- **Select option highlight (npm 0.4.1).** Hover and keyboard highlights now measure options from the viewport that draws the highlight, so its inset no longer shifts or clips the highlight.
+
 ## 2026-10-28
 
 ### Changed
